{"2273900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Waiftriss", "steam_appid": 2273900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//Description under development//</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waiftriss - FPS stylized shooter. Where skill and shooting prowess lead to victory, so team up and prove that you are the best.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273900/extras/a6704e127f573d9720628db4808e147f.webp?t=1785501577\" width=512 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WORLD OF WAIFTRISS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the city's daily life continues to flow through its routine, there are those who are willing to prove that it deserves to be heard by the people. This city, with its futuristic and future-oriented atmosphere, has yet to fully embrace its dirty streets and repetitive architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You're ready?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273900/extras/a6704e127f573d9720628db4808e147f.webp?t=1785501577\" width=512 height=23 /></span>         </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO SUN STREET</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A street known for its magnificent sunrises and sunsets, with mini-stores and dirty alleyways, immerse yourself in the atmosphere of this street's sunny yet soulless and gloomy history. Are you ready for an adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273900/extras/a6704e127f573d9720628db4808e147f.webp?t=1785501577\" width=512 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP / PvE modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero-based first-person shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique abilities &amp; weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic parkour system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive characters &amp; dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames (Arcade machine)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273900/extras/a6704e127f573d9720628db4808e147f.webp?t=1785501577\" width=512 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN TO OUR DISCORD SERVER FOR NEWS AND UPDATES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273900/extras/1aa075042e6d6c3d71fb65215eb44f16.webp?t=1785501577\" width=331 height=50 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//Description under development//</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waiftriss - FPS stylized shooter. Where skill and shooting prowess lead to victory, so team up and prove that you are the best.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273900/extras/a6704e127f573d9720628db4808e147f.webp?t=1785501577\" width=512 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WORLD OF WAIFTRISS</strong></p><p